---
// Visual before/after dashboard card showdown:
// Left: rainbow AI default where every widget uses a saturated accent and nothing reads as primary.
// Right: 90% cool tinted greys + 1 primary brand hue + 1 quiet flipped semantic status chip.

const W = 900;
const H = 348;
const padL = 24;
const colW = 412;
const rightX = padL + colW + 28;
---

<figure class="cbh">
  <div class="cbh-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Before and after comparison of a billing dashboard card. Left uses competing saturated purple, teal, orange, blue, pink, and green blocks. Right uses cool tinted grey surfaces, dark slate typography, one flipped green status chip, and a single blue primary button.">
      {/* Column headers */}
      <text x={padL} y="24" class="cbh-h-bad">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Before: competing saturated accents everywhere</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Trước: quá nhiều màu rực tranh nhau hút mắt</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x={rightX} y="24" class="cbh-h-good">
        <tspan data-lang-en>After: 90% tinted greys, one primary hue, quiet status</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Sau: 90% xám pha lạnh, một màu chính, nhãn dịu mắt</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* LEFT: Rainbow overload card */}
      <rect x={padL} y="40" width={colW} height="252" rx="10" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#d4d4d8" stroke-width="1" />
      {/* Loud purple header */}
      <path d={`M ${padL + 10} 40 H ${padL + colW - 10} Q ${padL + colW} 40 ${padL + colW} 50 V 88 H ${padL} V 50 Q ${padL} 40 ${padL + 10} 40 Z`} fill="#7c3aed" />
      <text x={padL + 18} y="70" fill="#ffffff" class="cbh-card-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Billing overview</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tổng quan thanh toán</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x={padL + colW - 92} y="53" width="76" height="24" rx="12" fill="#eab308" />
      <text x={padL + colW - 54} y="69" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffffff" class="cbh-chip">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Active</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đang bật</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Two loud stat tiles */}
      <rect x={padL + 18} y="106" width="182" height="92" rx="8" fill="#0d9488" />
      <text x={padL + 32} y="132" fill="#ccfbf1" class="cbh-stat-lbl">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Monthly spend</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chi phí tháng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x={padL + 32} y="168" fill="#ffffff" class="cbh-stat-val">$4,280</text>
      <text x={padL + 32} y="187" fill="#fef08a" class="cbh-stat-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>+8% vs last month</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>+8% so với tháng trước</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x={padL + 212} y="106" width="182" height="92" rx="8" fill="#ea580c" />
      <text x={padL + 226} y="132" fill="#ffedd5" class="cbh-stat-lbl">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Open invoices</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hóa đơn chờ</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x={padL + 226} y="168" fill="#ffffff" class="cbh-stat-val">12</text>
      <text x={padL + 226} y="187" fill="#ffedd5" class="cbh-stat-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>3 due this week</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>3 đến hạn tuần này</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Three competing saturated buttons */}
      <rect x={padL + 18} y="220" width="114" height="38" rx="6" fill="#2563eb" />
      <text x={padL + 75} y="244" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffffff" class="cbh-btn">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Export CSV</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Xuất CSV</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x={padL + 144} y="220" width="116" height="38" rx="6" fill="#db2777" />
      <text x={padL + 202} y="244" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffffff" class="cbh-btn">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Change plan</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đổi gói</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x={padL + 272} y="220" width="122" height="38" rx="6" fill="#16a34a" />
      <text x={padL + 333} y="244" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffffff" class="cbh-btn">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Pay balance</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Thanh toán</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x={padL} y="316" class="cbh-foot-bad">
        <tspan data-lang-en>6 bright hues shout at once — your eye has no anchor</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>6 màu rực cùng gào một lúc — mắt không biết nhìn vào đâu</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* RIGHT: Disciplined 90% cool grey + 1 primary hue */}
      <rect x={rightX} y="40" width={colW} height="252" rx="10" fill="#f8fafc" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1" />
      {/* Calm white header */}
      <path d={`M ${rightX + 10} 40 H ${rightX + colW - 10} Q ${rightX + colW} 40 ${rightX + colW} 50 V 88 H ${rightX} V 50 Q ${rightX} 40 ${rightX + 10} 40 Z`} fill="#ffffff" />
      <line x1={rightX} x2={rightX + colW} y1="88" y2="88" stroke="#e2e8f0" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x={rightX + 18} y="70" fill="#0f172a" class="cbh-card-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Billing overview</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tổng quan thanh toán</tspan>
      </text>
      {/* Flipped semantic status chip */}
      <rect x={rightX + colW - 92} y="53" width="76" height="24" rx="12" fill="#dcfce7" stroke="#86efac" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x={rightX + colW - 54} y="69" text-anchor="middle" fill="#166534" class="cbh-chip">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Active</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đang bật</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Two clean slate-neutral stat tiles */}
      <rect x={rightX + 18} y="106" width="182" height="92" rx="8" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#e2e8f0" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x={rightX + 32} y="132" fill="#475569" class="cbh-stat-lbl">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Monthly spend</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chi phí tháng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x={rightX + 32} y="168" fill="#0f172a" class="cbh-stat-val">$4,280</text>
      <text x={rightX + 32} y="187" fill="#64748b" class="cbh-stat-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>+8% vs last month</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>+8% so với tháng trước</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x={rightX + 212} y="106" width="182" height="92" rx="8" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#e2e8f0" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x={rightX + 226} y="132" fill="#475569" class="cbh-stat-lbl">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Open invoices</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hóa đơn chờ</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x={rightX + 226} y="168" fill="#0f172a" class="cbh-stat-val">12</text>
      <text x={rightX + 226} y="187" fill="#b45309" class="cbh-stat-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>3 due this week</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>3 đến hạn tuần này</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Two quiet grey secondary buttons + ONE primary brand button */}
      <rect x={rightX + 18} y="220" width="114" height="38" rx="6" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x={rightX + 75} y="244" text-anchor="middle" fill="#334155" class="cbh-btn">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Export CSV</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Xuất CSV</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x={rightX + 144} y="220" width="116" height="38" rx="6" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x={rightX + 202} y="244" text-anchor="middle" fill="#334155" class="cbh-btn">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Change plan</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đổi gói</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x={rightX + 272} y="220" width="122" height="38" rx="6" fill="#2563eb" />
      <text x={rightX + 333} y="244" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffffff" class="cbh-btn">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Pay balance</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Thanh toán</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x={rightX} y="316" class="cbh-foot-good">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Cool greys carry structure so the one blue action wins</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Xám lạnh gánh khung nền để duy nhất nút xanh nổi bật</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Most of a clean interface is grey. Reserve your primary brand hue for the single action you want users to notice first, and keep status accents light and restrained.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Phần lớn một giao diện sạch là màu xám. Hãy giữ màu thương hiệu chính cho đúng hành động quan trọng nhất, và dùng màu trạng thái nhẹ tay.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .cbh { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .cbh-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .cbh svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .cbh text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .cbh text.cbh-h-bad { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .cbh text.cbh-h-good { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .cbh text.cbh-card-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; }
  .cbh text.cbh-chip { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .cbh text.cbh-stat-lbl { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; }
  .cbh text.cbh-stat-val { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; }
  .cbh text.cbh-stat-sub { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 500; }
  .cbh text.cbh-btn { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
  .cbh text.cbh-foot-bad { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--red); }
  .cbh text.cbh-foot-good { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .cbh figcaption { margin-top: 0.6em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
